# ToolKit 🧰

A free, all-in-one Android utility app built with Flutter. No ads, no signup, no hidden costs — just tools that work, offline.

---

## 📥 Installation

### Option 1: Download the APK (easiest)
1. Go to the [Releases](../../releases) page of this repo
2. Download the latest `app-release.apk` file
3. On your Android phone, open the downloaded file
4. If prompted "Install blocked" or "Unknown sources", go to **Settings → Security** (or tap the prompt directly) and allow installation from this source
5. Tap **Install**, then open the app once it's done

### Option 2: Build from source
If you want to build it yourself or contribute to the project:

```bash
# 1. Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/your-username/toolkit.git
cd toolkit

# 2. Install Flutter dependencies
flutter pub get

# 3. Connect an Android device or start an emulator
flutter devices

# 4. Run the app in debug mode
flutter run

# OR build a release APK
flutter build apk --release
```

The built APK will be at `build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-release.apk`.

**Requirements:**
- Flutter SDK installed ([flutter.dev/get-started](https://flutter.dev/get-started))
- Android SDK (comes with Android Studio)
- A `.env` file with a `GEMINI_API_KEY` if you want the AI Image Generator tool to work (see below)

