## ✨ Features

### 🖼️ Image Tools
| Tool | What it does |
|---|---|
| **Image Cropper** | Crop any photo to a custom or preset aspect ratio (1:1, 4:3, 16:9, free) |
| **Image Compressor** | Shrink an image's file size with an adjustable quality slider, shows before/after size |
| **WebP to PNG** | Converts `.webp` images to the more widely-supported `.png` format |
| **EXIF Viewer & Remover** | Shows a photo's hidden metadata (camera, date, GPS location) and strips it before you share the image, for privacy |
| **AI Image Generator** | Type a description, get an AI-generated image back — powered by Google's Gemini API |

### 📄 PDF Tools
| Tool | What it does |
|---|---|
| **PNG to PDF** | Turns one or more images into a single PDF file |
| **PDF to PNG** | Extracts every page of a PDF as individual PNG images |
| **PDF Splitter** | Pulls out specific pages or a page range from a PDF into a new file |
| **PDF Merger** | Combines multiple PDFs into one, in an order you choose |
| **Text to PDF** | Type or paste text and generate a formatted, multi-page PDF from it |

### 🔧 Everyday Utilities
| Tool | What it does |
|---|---|
| **QR Code Generator** | Turns any text or URL into a scannable QR code, savable as an image |
| **Markdown Editor** | Write Markdown with a live side-by-side preview |
| **Password Generator** | Creates secure random passwords with adjustable length and character rules |
| **Word & Character Counter** | Live word count, character count, and estimated reading time as you type |

